# SPRITE SHEET STATUS

No release-ready Gully sprite sheet is available yet. The previous 8×9 plan in this placeholder was superseded by the v2 layout in `pet.json`.

## Generation Instructions

1. Continue the preserved run under `generation/2026-09-14/`.
2. Finish all nine animation rows and sixteen look directions.
3. Assemble and validate the v2 sprite sheet using the current Work Pets workflow.
4. Add `gully-spritesheet.png` only after final validation. The v2 dimensions are 1536×2288 pixels (8 columns × 11 rows, 192×208px cells).

## Current Status

🟡 **IN PROGRESS** - Base art and several animation strips exist, but the v2 sheet is incomplete and has not passed final validation. See `../../RECONCILIATION.md` and `generation/2026-09-14/README.md`.

